{"name":"Fairy Floss","hex":"#ebc9c6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fairy floss","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Synonym of cotton candy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fairy_floss"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cotton candy","blocks":[{"text":"Cotton candy, also known as candy floss (candyfloss) and fairy floss, is a spun sugar confection that resembles cotton. It is made by heating and liquefying sugar, and spinning it centrifugally through minute holes, causing it to rapidly cool and re-solidify into fine strands. It usually contains small amounts of food flavoring and it naturally bears the color of the sugar it is made of, often altered with food coloring."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Cotton_candy_%CE%9C%CE%B1%CE%BB%CE%BB%CE%AF_%CF%84%CE%B7%CF%82_%CE%B3%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%AC%CF%82.JPG/330px-Cotton_candy_%CE%9C%CE%B1%CE%BB%CE%BB%CE%AF_%CF%84%CE%B7%CF%82_%CE%B3%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%AC%CF%82.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cotton_candy"},{"title":"Fairy","blocks":[{"text":"A fairy is a type of mythical being or legendary creature, generally described as anthropomorphic, found in the folklore of multiple European cultures, a form of spirit, often with magical, metaphysical, supernatural, or preternatural qualities."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Falero_Luis_Ricardo_Lily_Fairy_1888.jpg/330px-Falero_Luis_Ricardo_Lily_Fairy_1888.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg/500px-Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg/1280px-Cotton_Candy_Machine.jpg?utm_source=